[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]　•  嘉靖本伏兵描述不同（"皆後伏兵起，軍馬擁出"）；志传系/毛本更简洁（"忽然伏兵四起"）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[indent]3.  [color=#000000]志传系与毛宗岗本在陈横段落上高度一致[/color]，无实质差异[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
